{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016000/extras/7f17f663d7ee62b5b6c477dc0239d377.avif?t=1772201688\" width=1024 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2023 Best family game at the German Computer Game Award</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Magical Floating Fortress is an interactive picture book that takes even the youngest members of the family on an entertaining journey with its child-friendly story. Three siblings set off to find their beloved chicken Berta. In the process, they stumble across the mysterious Fortress, in which magical rooms await the young adventurers alongside crazy instruments. The conflicts that arise in the course of the story bring action to the gaming experience, but are never overwhelming or frightening. At the end of each chapter, a short quiz offers the opportunity to playfully test the child's attention and understanding of the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 12 exciting chapters, you can accompany the three siblings as they explore the magical floating fortress and search for their missing hen Berta in a snow-covered river landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016000/extras/070dd8a018b26f2c329c9bc7e1752176.avif?t=1772201688\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READING IS FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading and playing - that's what it's all about! The world behind the words unfolds through lovingly animated, interactive illustrations. The intuitive controls are fun and allow children to get up close and personal with the story. You move fluidly through forests, follow rivers and enter secret places together with the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's lots to discover: little hidden figures and fun mini-games make for a very special reading experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >QUIZ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you been paying attention? A quiz awaits you after each chapter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016000/extras/9b0e6aa4d4a834d3d506fdb71b60fcff.avif?t=1772201688\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND LITTLE CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you look closely, you can discover lots of little woodland creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016000/extras/0af2678162092af9b73e741483788653.avif?t=1772201688\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/4f8e1e25b3ef3d2ad6a5c5fa2ca88369e31f3685.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/4cb0f788926391b1be273290f9ad91f1155ea43f.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/8fab5d82269cf1b5bc989aeeff6672eee2a24d53.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/b8011cc9a56a036f98e4d271244415960dc53a03.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/244b6d540a204f809b6ae754a0fd62a871d50672.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/bead151bd99d778e7af564ff36f9d3e3728ea00b.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4016000/d7e5a5d6cdcceaa6f9882bd979177887bfefa86a.jpg"}